24\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(6,24,15)\">Josh 24:15</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), possibly also <ref ref=\"Gen 36:37\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(1,36,37)\">Gen 36:37</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>; compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup>) = <ref ref=\"1Chr 1:48\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"48\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"48\" onclick=\"bcv(13,1,48)\">1Chr 1:48</ref>, + 13 t. + <ref ref=\"2Sam 8:3\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(10,8,3)\">2Sam 8:3</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> (see above); and even without article (poetry) <ref ref=\"Isa 7:20\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(23,7,20)\">Isa 7:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 2:18\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(24,2,18)\">Jer 2:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mic 7:12\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(33,7,12)\">Mic 7:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 9:10\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(38,9,10)\">Zech 9:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 72:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"72\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"72\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,72,8)\">Ps 72:8</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַגּ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַנּ</bdbheb> once of Tigris <ref ref=\"Dan 10:4\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(27,10,4)\">Dan 10:4</ref> <bdbheb>נְהַר גוֺזָן</bdbheb> (<bdbheb>חבור</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:6\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,6)\">2Kgs 17:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:11\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,11)\">2Kgs 18:11</ref> compare <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"2Chr 5:26\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(14,5,26)\">2Chr 5:26</ref> plural <bdbheb>נַהֲרֵי בוּשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zeph 3:10\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(36,3,10)\">Zeph 3:10</ref> perhaps of a <highlight>canal:</highlight> <bdbheb>נְהַרכְּֿבָר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 1:1\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(26,1,1)\">Ezek 1:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 1:3\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(26,1,3)\">Ezek 1:3</ref> + 6 t. Ezekiel; <bdbheb>הַנָּהָר אַהֲלוא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezra 8:21\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(15,8,21)\">Ezra 8:21</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נְהַר א</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Ezra 8:31\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(15,8,31)\">Ezra 8:31</ref> compare <bdbheb>נַהֲרוֺת בָּבֶל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 137:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"137\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"137\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,137,1)\">Ps 137:1</ref> <highlight>canals</highlight> possibly also in <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שַׁעֲרֵי הַנּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Nah 2:7\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(34,2,7)\">Nah 2:7</ref> (of Nineveh); of <highlight>canals</highlight> of Egypt <ref ref=\"Exod 7:19\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(2,7,19)\">Exod 7:19</ref> (|| <bdbheb>יְאֹרִים</bdbheb> etc.), <ref ref=\"Exod 8:1\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(2,8,1)\">Exod 8:1</ref> (|| id.). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <bdbheb>נְהָרוֺת</bdbheb> (<bdbheb>מִבְּכִי</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Job 28:11\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(18,28,11)\">Job 28:11</ref> usually understood of <highlight>(underground) streams</highlight>; Szold<sup>Comm. Job</sup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gr')\">Gr<sup>Monatsschr.1887, 410 and</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Perles')\">Perles<sup>Analekten 69</sup></lookup> proposes <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נִבְכֵ</bdbheb> <highlight>sources of rivers</highlight> (compare <ref ref=\"Job 36:16\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(18,36,16)\">Job 36:16</ref>); <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Wetzst')\">Wetzst</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hoffm')\">Hoffm</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bu')\">Bu</lookup> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מַבְּכֵ</bdbheb> (not elsewhere) with similar meaning. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> figurative of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> s favour <ref ref=\"Ps 46:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,46,5)\">Ps 46:5</ref>. — On <bdbheb>נַהֲרַיִם</bdbheb> ending apparently dual, see <bdbheb>אֲרַם</bdbheb>; Tel Amarna <transliteration><highlight>Na-ri-ma, Na—rima</highlight></transliteration> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Wkl')\">Wkl<sup>Tel Am. 40</sup></lookup>*), and Egyptian <transliteration><highlight>Nhrina</highlight></transliteration> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('WMM')\">WMM<sup>As.u.Eur.249ff.</sup></lookup>) point however to original ending <bdbheb>יִ֯ם</bdbheb>; this inconsistent with view of <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Mey')\">EMey<sup>Geschichte. § 180</sup></lookup> that <bdbheb>יִַ֯ם</bdbheb> here a <highlight>locative</highlight> ending (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ba')\">Ba<sup>§ 194 c. Anm. l</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl<sup>Ges 12</sup></lookup>), see also <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di<sup><ref ref=\"Gen 24:10\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,10)\">Gen 24:10</ref></sup></lookup>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 2:10", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 2, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Deut 1:7", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 1, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Isa 18:27", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 18, "verse": 27}, {"raw": "Isa 18:1", "book": "ISA",